msgstr "- [Amplitude Browser SDK 2](https://www.amplitude.com/docs/sdks/analytics/browser/browser-sdk-2) — SDK-Initialisierung und Zustellreceipts.\n"
"- [createAnalytics](/reference/createAnalytics) — gemeinsamer Engine-Lifecycle."

